/* ================= t337 UI polish: one look, a sound for every action, a way out of every panel (t337/run_m1/NOTES.md, notes_D).
   1 Shops: the header and Leave stay put and only the list scrolls, with a little arrow while there's more below. Costs show the way
     the benches show them (an icon and have/need for each thing, the coin icon beside the price), story goods sit at the top while
     the story wants them, and a button never prints its price twice. ================= */
